date - display the hardware clock

SYNOPSIS
    date

DESCRIPTION
    Print the calendar date and time from /dev/rtc in year-month-day
    and 24-hour notation. The value follows the firmware clock.

EXIT STATUS
    Zero on success or one if the clock cannot be read.

SEE ALSO
    uptime(1), dev(5)
